> Required modules: `bundle`, `spec`, `witness`, `runner`, `report`, `oracle`, `loop`. Required dependencies: `anyhow`, `clap`, `reqwest`, `serde`, `serde_json`, `toml`, `sha2`, `tempfile`. No others.
